        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He draws a bolt through his long fingers and nods slowly* Clean-cut, and strong. My weavers will put it to better use than its makers ever did. *a steward counts out your bounty* Three hundred gold of the realm, and the thanks of Eryn Lasgalen. Come again tomorrow -- the dark breeds them faster than we can cull them."
