        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Thranduil, King of Eryn Lasgalen, regards you from his carved throne* The great spiders choke my wood -- spawn of Ungoliant's brood, every one. Yet their silk is stronger than steel wire, and my weavers prize it. Bring me six bolts of spider silk cut from the spiders of Mirkwood and you shall have three hundred gold. Once each day, no more."
          }
        }
      },
